OL,3,GNEWSAMarvel fans to meet Welsh
OL,4,Asuperhero - complete with Cardiff
OL,5,Aaccent
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarvel fans around the world are set to
OL,8,Fmeet a Welsh villain - complete with a
OL,9,FCardiff accent.
OL,11,FLauren Morais, from the Welsh capital,
OL,12,Fwill play Lisa Molinari in the new
OL,13,Fsuperhero series VisionQuest - a
OL,14,Fspin-off from the miniseries
OL,15,FWandaVision.
OL,17,FThe Disney+ show, exploring whether AI
OL,18,Fand humanity can co-exist, also stars
OL,19,FPaul Bettany, returning as Vision, and
OL,20,FJames Spader as Ultron.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
