OL,5,Aaccent
OL,6,
OL,7,FMorais said getting the role was a
OL,8,F"pinch me" moment and that she was
OL,9,F"very proud" to introduce her accent to
OL,10,Fthe Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU).
